]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[Completed June 1882. This portion, which came in from Lehi via Fairfield, was abandoned upon the completion of the Leamington Cutoff (SPLA&SL). See http://utahrails.net/utahrails/salt-lake-western.php for more information.]]></description>
