      <Placemark>
        <name>Shay Park
</name>
        <description><![CDATA[While residential development destroyed most of the grade in this area, a small portion was preserved in a city park designed with a railroad theme. The Utah Live Steamers club maintains a large 7.5" gauge railroad and signal garden here to commemorate the Salt Lake & Western.]]></description>
